WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Case 2: the amount column is renamed from amount_usd to total_amount. Same values. (Re-run recorded after the fact.)

00:02.000 --> 00:11.000
Step 1: upload the case 2 file to S3 as input/orders.csv.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.000
Step 2: run the same pipeline in Rhombus. (The red boxes are left over from the last case.)

00:15.000 --> 00:22.000
It fails at the cleaning step again: "Pipeline failed at orders_cleaned".

00:22.000 --> 00:29.000
The log just says 'amount_usd'. It doesn't say the column was renamed, or that total_amount looks like the same thing.

00:29.000 --> 00:35.000
And again there's a "Pipeline execution completed successfully" line right next to the failure.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Step 3: Google Cloud Storage. No new file, so nothing bad got out. Safe stop, unhelpful message.
